# Day-to-day: producer, queue, worker pool, dead-letter queue; fan-out from the queue, fan-in to the DB and DLQ.
title "Queue and workers"
dir RIGHT
producer[Producer]
queue{Job queue} :yellow
w1[Worker 1]
w2[Worker 2]
w3[Worker 3]
db[(Results DB)] :teal
dlq{Dead-letter queue} :red
producer -> queue : enqueue
queue -> w1, w2, w3 : dequeue
w1, w2, w3 -> db : store
w1, w2, w3 --> dlq : failed
